About third-party software

In addition to the above, this product includes the following third-party
software. These are not covered by Apache-2.0 and are subject to their
respective original license terms. The full text is given in the header
comment at the top of each file.

1. Nordic SoftDevice S113 v7.2.0 (binary), MBR, and related headers
   Provider: Nordic Semiconductor ASA
   License: Nordic 5-Clause License (full text in each header file)
   Included path: components/softdevice/
   Source: https://github.com/lancaster-university/codal-microbit-v2
           (lib/softdevice.o and lib/mbr.o. The contents are identified by
           the SHA-256 values below)
     softdevice.o:
       b2e30d0707422cb6789c941c4c30a8333f0a45afbd59cdfd6b63367b6e11f817
     mbr.o:
       e9fb2924734ea324e1976fb10a481ffb65f79c495c6f6fb14b99272fc1c86ba9
   Note: This software is used and redistributed only as embedded in an
         integrated circuit made by Nordic Semiconductor ASA (the nRF52833
         on the micro:bit v2). It has not been modified.

2. BLE modules etc. of the nRF5 SDK (ble_nus.c, ble_advertising.c,
   nrf_sdh.c and others)
   Provider: Nordic Semiconductor ASA
   License: Nordic 5-Clause License (full text at the top of each file)
   Included path: components/ble/, components/nrf5sdk/
   Source: https://www.nordicsemi.com/Products/Development-software/nRF5-SDK
   Note: This software is used only as embedded in an integrated circuit made
         by Nordic Semiconductor ASA (same as above).

3. Three headers derived from the nRF5 SDK (modified by benus): nrf.h,
   sdk_common.h, util.h
   Original work: Nordic Semiconductor ASA
   Modified by: koh aiaida (koh@aiaida.jp), 2025
   License: Nordic 5-Clause License (Nordic's original copyright notice and
            full license text are kept in each file, and a notice of the
            modifier is added at the end)
   Included path: components/nrf5sdk/
   Source: modified versions of the same nRF5 SDK as in 2. above

4. CMSIS headers (core_cm4.h, cmsis_gcc.h and others)
