--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

What this repository does not contain

The μT-Kernel 3.0 (micro:bit version) distributed by PMC (Personal Media
Corporation) is not included in this repository. To use benus, you need to
obtain PMC's distribution (362_mbit_mtk3.zip) separately and apply the patches
with the scripts under patch/. When using it, follow the distribution terms of
Personal Media Corporation.

About the prebuilt demo hex

The prebuilt demo hex provided separately for the contest judging is not
included in this repository. This hex contains the binaries of the third-party
software 1 to 4 above (SoftDevice S113 and MBR, the BLE modules of the nRF5
SDK, etc.) and the μT-Kernel 3.0 (micro:bit version) distributed by Personal
Media Corporation, with benus's patches applied. Each is subject to the
license terms given above, or to the distribution terms of Personal Media
Corporation.

